# mark: Promise jobs ============================================================================

## A promise job: GC::Function<ThrowCompletionOr<Value>()>. The result is the job's completion
## (a fallible result cannot be a GC::Function's type argument, DESIGN.md §2.7).
pub type JsPromiseJobFunction = gc.Function0[JsCompletion]

## JS::PromiseJob (Libraries/LibJS/Runtime/PromiseJobs.h:16): a job and the realm it runs in.
pub struct JsPromiseJob:
    pub var job: JsPromiseJobFunction*
    pub var realm: Realm*?
